ScavengerShop: {
	EssencesButtonText: Essences
	EssenceChanceDialogText: The current essence drop chance from monsters is {0}%.
	SpawnMessageText: The Scavenger has arrived!
	AngryDialog2Text: Oh, wonderful! You scattered this pollen everywhere attracting pig-thieves, and now I have to clean up after you! Keep it, thief, I'm not dropping anything else for you!
	AngryDialog1Text: Think I'll just give you everything that easily? Bring the pollen first, be glad! And don't you dare 'accidentally' drop pollen during processing — I'm watching, and I get offended easily.
	Dialog3Text: Have you ever tried taking something away from a pig-thief? It's absolutely unbearable! They'll devour anything down to clean bones, and I won't even find leftover scraps after...
	Dialog2Text: I tried cooking myself a crispy crust once. Rubbed myself with rare essences, but ended up nearly getting eaten by a pig. Overall, excellent seasoning if you don't have standard spices!
	Dialog1Text: I once accidentally covered a pig-thief in stinky sludge, and that carcass attracted a whole swarm of scavengers! And... I started hallucinating from whatever I inhaled off that carcass...
	ChatButtonText: Shop
	NPCNameText: Scavenger
	NotEnoughPollenText: Not enough pollen!
	MaterialDescText: ???
	QuantityText: Quantity:
	BuyText: Buy
	SelectProductText: Select an item to purchase
}

